cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use metaScreener in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "metaScreener: A Plugin-Based Desktop Application for Human-in-the-Loop Systematic Literature Screening"
abstract: "metaScreener is an open-source, cross-platform desktop application implemented in Python/Tkinter that delivers a sequential, multi-stage pipeline for systematic literature screening. The software integrates deterministic rule-based filters with large language model (LLM) inference to automate high-volume citation screening within structured evidence synthesis workflows. Each screening decision is logged within a timestamped, SHA-256-verified bundle archive."
